# The Shape of Tomorrow
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
When I can walk farther, I will still want to stop here.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
At the old well?
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
At a place we reached slowly.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
We can come back as often as you like.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
And leave as often as I like.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You realize that both promises matter.
